# Assets Directory

Place your static video file here:

- `/assets/static.mp4` - TV static video for offline state

The stream player will automatically load this file when the broadcast is offline.
The video should:
- Loop
- Look like old TV static / no signal
- Be muted by default
- Fill the entire player area

## Streaming Setup

The website supports HLS streaming. Configure your stream URL in the admin panel.

Typical OBS streaming workflow:
1. OBS → Stream to your streaming service (e.g., YouTube Live, Twitch, custom RTMP server)
2. Streaming service provides HLS URL (e.g., `https://stream.example.com/live/stream.m3u8`)
3. Enter HLS URL in admin panel
4. Website automatically plays the live stream

The static video will be replaced by the live stream when you go live.
